{title: Yad Lagla}
{artist: Sairat Ajay Atul}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]yaad laagal ga [E]yaad laagal ga
[F]rangal tujhyat [G]yaad laagal ga
[Am]vaas hyo [E]usaat yei kasturicha
[F]chakhlaya vaar [G]gwaad laagal ga
[C]chaand bhasato [G]disaach maavlaya laagal
[C]aas laagali manaat [G]kaalvaya laagal ga
[Am]yaad laagal ga [E]yaad laagal ga
[F]rangal tujhyat [G]yaad laagal ga
[Am]vaas hyo [E]usaat yei kasturicha
[F]chakhlaya vaar [G]gwaad laagal ga
[Am]sangvana bolvana [G]man zurtay durum
[Dm]palataya taltay [E]valtay maag firun
[Am]sajal ga dhajal [G]ga laaj kaajal saaral
[Dm]yendhal he gondhalal [E]laad laad gel harun
[C]bhalal as [G]uraat paalvaya laagal
[C]odh laagali [G]manaat chalvaya laagal
